<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25400" root="ضأز" body-key="D">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَأَزَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَاَ^َ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَأْزٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَأَزٌ</span>, <i>He deviated
from the right course;</i> or <i>acted unjustly, wrongfully, injuriously,</i> or <i>tyrannically;</i> (K;) like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَازَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضُوزُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضِيزُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَأَزَهُ حَقَّهُ</span>,
(K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَاَ^َ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَأْزٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَآزٌ</span>, (TA,) [but the
latter is probably a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَأَزٌ</span>,] <i>He deprived
him,</i> or <i>defrauded him, of a part,</i> or <i>the whole, of
his right,</i> or <i>due:</i> (K:) <i>he refused it to him;</i> or
<i>withheld it from him:</i> (TA:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَازَهُ إِيَّاهُ</span>, aor.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضِيزُهُ</span> (S * and K * and TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضيز</span>) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضُوزُهُ</span>.
(K * and TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضوز</span>.)

